        {
          "name": "Vampiric Touch",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 3,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "death",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 living creature",
          "save": "basic fortitude",
          "description": "<p>Your touch leeches the lifeblood out of a target to empower yourself. You deal <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">6d6</span> void damage to the target. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the void damage the target takes (after applying resistances and the like). You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span>.</p>",
